    {
      "principle": "A husband's offer to maintain his wife on condition of her living with him is not a valid ground for denying her maintenance.",
      "held": "If such person offers to maintain his wife on condition of her living with him, and she refuses to live with him, such Magistrate may consider any grounds of refusal stated by her, and may make an order under this section notwithstanding such offer, if he is satisfied that there is just ground for so doing.",
